OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with well broken cloud,
OL,7,Fsome clear spells possible. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain reaching Orkney around
OL,9,Fmidnight and perhaps Shetland through
OL,10,Fthe early hours. Starting to ease over
OL,11,FOrkney towards morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FRain soon clearing Orkney,
OL,14,Fheavy and times for Shetland before
OL,15,Fclearing by lunchtime. Then largely
OL,16,Fdry and bright conditions in the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Scattered showers arriving
OL,18,Flater with freshening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
