OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStrong
OL,6,Fwesterly winds with showers on Friday.
OL,7,FBright spells and showers Saturday
OL,8,Fwith winds easing. Rain and stronger
OL,9,Fwinds pushing north on Sunday.
